                     format is described in rreeggeexxpp__ttaabbllee(5).

              ssddbbmm   An indexed file type based on hashing.  Available on sys‐
                     tems with support for SDBM databases.

                     This feature is available with Postfix 2.2 and later.

              ssoocckkeettmmaapp (read-only)
                     Sendmail-style   socketmap  client.  The  table  name  is
                     iinneett:_h_o_s_t:_p_o_r_t:_n_a_m_e for a TCP/IP  server,  or  uunniixx:_p_a_t_h_‐
                     _n_a_m_e:_n_a_m_e  for a UNIX-domain server. This is described in
                     ssoocckkeettmmaapp__ttaabbllee(5).

                     This feature is available with Postfix 2.10 and later.

              ssqqlliittee (read-only)
