                     For example, ssttaattiicc::ffoooobbaarr always returns the string ffoooo‐‐
                     bbaarr  as lookup result. Specify "ssttaattiicc::{{ _t_e_x_t _w_i_t_h _w_h_i_t_e_‐
                     _s_p_a_c_e }}" when the result contains whitespace;  this  form
